[Quotes]
victory0 = "Uh, um, at times like these a vampire would say... I-I will save your life, so please keep me a secret - right?"
victory1 = "I-I'm sorry...! I counterattacked wildly, did you somehow manage to survive?"
victory2 = "You're pretty unlucky. Meeting me while I'm in a bad mood is just about as bad now as when I was my former self."
victory3 = "Don't underestimate me. Despite how I look, people say I have a natural talent that appears only once every few years."
victory4 = "Whew, I somehow made it. Oh man, I'm getting used to all this violence."
victory5 = "No way, I won...!? Um, uh, sorry, I'll stop!"
victory6 = "I'm okay, I'm alright! I've been through a lot, but I always look forward!"
victory50 = "Bring out some food now! Bring me 100 rations of water and food! That's an order, you! No one can defy me!" 
victory51 = "Time to teach you idle dreamers about strength!"
victory52 = "Out of my way, trash!"
victory53 = "Winning is all that matters, whether you cheat or not!"
victory54 = "All I've come for is victory. I hate naive duty and compassion!"
victory55 = "You got me angry... I'll beat you into a pulp!"
victory56 = "I always get the last laugh!"